<title>BRAZIL: Telerj posts Jan net of 18.2 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telerj posts Jan net of 18.2 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telecomunicacoes do Rio de Janeiro S.A. (Telerj) released the following preliminary results for January 1997.</p>
<p>			 Jan 1997	    Jan 1996</p>
<p>Net		    18.161 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Gross Revs	   142.3 million	     N/A</p>
<p>Net Revs	     107.8 million	     N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais. The company is a unit of the federal Telebras system serving Rio de Janeiro state.</p>
<p>Comparative figures for January 1996 were not provided.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413))</p>
